<font color=white>Ixiblat Fer</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=186&lastnode_id=1686">Zhokaii</a> on 2001-04-28 09:24:51</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>Tonight! Saturday da 29th! We gonna kill Ixiblat Fer wit Korsis! We gonna do it four times. Three times fer dere clerics an' once for Izayo! Izayo is our only cleric far enough along in her epic quest to kill it fer. Dis am da start of a guud ting. Bloodhorde gonna be doin' lotsa raids wit Korsis prolly. Particularly we gonna help each other on cleric and warrior epic quests since dey so damn hard!!!! Tonight is one of da biggest steps fer Izayo's epic quest so please, if'n you level 50 or higher an' can possibly make it dere, please do!!! GRAAAAARRRR!!!!<br>
<br>
also, they have asked we come wearing lots of fire resist gear. I think this is mainly important for melee types that will be in range of it's area effect. They requested we all have our unbuffed fire resistance up to 130. ACK! I know that's a very steep request on such short notice so basically do what you can. =)</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr>

<tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1689&lastnode_id=1686">Re: Ixiblat Fer</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1641&lastnode_id=1686">Geos</a> on 2001-04-28 22:18:00</font></nowrap></td></tr>
<tr><td colspan=2>It turns out Fire Resist isnt as big of a deal as we thought (the AE wasnt the main problem with fighting him), .  I am extremely happy with the turnout from BH members, and that we finished this part for Izayo =).  Look forward to seeing you guys again.<br>
<br>
/em runs aways before he's eaten!</td></tr><tr><td colspan=2>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor=#333333>
<font color=white><A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1690&lastnode_id=1686">Re: Ixiblat Fer</a> (0 Replies)</font></td>
<td align=right bgcolor=#333333>
<nowrap><font color=white>Posted by <A HREF="/index.pl?node_id=1641&lastnode_id=1686">Geos</a> on 2001-04-29 04:42:06</font></nowrap></td></tr>
